    "The full baseline source 071c4f06426ea06a66419e4ffd208a3cb7c2bb7f and optimized source 1c8ff12d5b618c7b8f9ae0365d8791e1e558d815 also differ in benchmark literals and lifetime code, so full-matrix before/after ratios are confounded cross-campaign sensitivity observations.",
    "The focused n=5 baseline db49c0fcc80b19b32f440a2c41e37dd60fb11b10 is the direct parent of optimized source 1c8ff12d5b618c7b8f9ae0365d8791e1e558d815, and their diff is limited to unialloc/src/cache/thread_cache.rs and unialloc/src/freelist/mod.rs.",
    "The focused before/after panel has five measured fresh processes per variant and reports descriptive medians and ranges.",
    "The PSS probe performs fixed page allocations, touches every page, and samples five independent processes at named checkpoints.",
    "Warm-run retention applies only to the default hosted intrusive backend and is bounded by per-run, slot-count, and aggregate-byte limits.",
    "Two descending-sort leaves are link-layout sensitive: a seven-process same-source audit shifted optimized commit 1c8ff12 .text forward 16 bytes, restored their old fetch-block alignment and medians, and left ascending controls within 0.21%. Allocator-specific claims exclude these leaves."
